{"speciesId":494,"names":{"fr":"Victini","es":"Victini","en":"Victini","ja":"ビクティニ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon qui amène la victoire. On dit que les Dresseurs qui le possèdent peuvent gagner n’importe quel combat."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps produit une énergie sans limites qu’il peut partager avec ceux qu’il touche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It creates an unlimited supply of energy inside its body, which it shares with those who touch it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon qui amène la victoire. On dit que les Dresseurs qui le possèdent peuvent gagner n’importe quel combat."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon que atrae la victoria. Dicen que el Entrenador que lo lleve saldrá vencedor de cualquier batalla."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"勝利を もたらす ポケモン。 ビクティニを 連れた トレーナーは どんな 勝負にも 勝てるという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"L’énergie sans limites qu’il produit donne une force incroyable à ceux qui entrent en contact avec elle."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando Victini comparte su energía ilimitada, esa persona o Pokémon irradia abundante poder."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power."},{"language":"ja","version"